erview":"Mientras los militares llegan a la calle Neibolt, los chicos se adentran en las alcantarillas con su propia misión.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/wDTjvS7dTnIko5JukSzgYSa3QQW.jpg","released":"2025-11-23T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"56 min"},{"id":"tt19244304:1:6","season":1,"episode":6,"title":"En el Nombre del Padre⁩","overview":"Atormentado por visiones oscuras, Dick recibe una sorpresa en el Black Spot. Mientras tanto, los chicos enfrentan sus propios desafíos.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/6phQvyEMeX84oeRznxnJWAM91dz.jpg","released":"2025-11-30T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"57 min"},{"id":"tt19244304:1:7","season":1,"episode":7,"title":"⁨El Black Spot⁩","overview":"Un ataque al Black Spot desata fuerzas dormidas. Tras la tragedia, Dick ayuda a descubrir otro artefacto crucial.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/zOAW0v0WLV7vv636Cx8VfSYSktu.jpg","released":"2025-12-07T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"62 min"},{"id":"tt19244304:1:8","season":1,"episode":8,"title":"Fuego de Invierno⁩","overview":"Mientras Shaw avanza con su misión, los Hanlon, Rose, Dick y los chicos descubren que está en sus manos salvar a Derry.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/8gqmWZUs4GAH1QfqR2u3aXxX5Q2.jpg","released":"2025-12-14T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"69 min"},{"id":"tt19244304:2:1","season":2,"episode":1,"title":"The Bradley"},{"id":"tt19244304:0:2","season":0,"episode":2,"title":"Inside Derry #1","overview":"\"Inside Derry #1\" Featurette.","released":"2025-10-26T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"6 min"},{"id":"tt19244304:0:3","season":0,"episode":3,"title":"Inside Derry #2","overview":"\"Inside Derry #2\" Featurette.","released":"2025-11-02T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"6 min"},{"id":"tt19244304:0:4","season":0,"episode":4,"title":"Inside Derry #3","overview":"\"Inside Derry #3\" Featurette.","released":"2025-11-09T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"7 min"},{"id":"tt19244304:0:5","season":0,"episode":5,"title":"Inside Derry #4","overview":"\"Inside Derry #4\"